WEBVTT

01:40.360 --> 01:42.820
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.590 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 3]

01:46.070 --> 01:46.420
[Danyue Pavilion]

01:46.420 --> 01:50.350
[Nineteen years ago]

01:50.509 --> 01:51.350
Jin Chunqing!

01:52.509 --> 01:53.840
How dare you put poison?

01:55.870 --> 01:57.070
Poison?

01:58.590 --> 01:59.479
I don't know.

01:59.479 --> 02:01.150
You're already on your deathbed,

02:01.150 --> 02:02.950
yet you still refuse to admit it.

02:25.150 --> 02:26.120
My Lady.

02:26.680 --> 02:28.280
Several servants just came in.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.630
Without saying a word,

02:29.660 --> 02:30.630
they took our luggage away.

02:30.630 --> 02:31.840
They said Second Madam ordered them

02:31.840 --> 02:33.150
to move us to another courtyard.

02:33.150 --> 02:34.560
Those who know understand we're moving,

02:34.560 --> 02:35.800
but those who don't might think

02:35.800 --> 02:37.130
we're being kicked out.

02:37.520 --> 02:39.180
Moving to another courtyard?

02:39.430 --> 02:41.400
We were doing fine in this courtyard.

02:41.400 --> 02:42.600
Why do we have to move?

02:43.079 --> 02:43.740
Step aside.

02:44.680 --> 02:46.480
No matter how good this place is,

02:46.520 --> 02:48.030
it's for guests.

02:48.750 --> 02:50.870
Since you've been recorded
in the genealogy,

02:50.870 --> 02:54.120
we have to arrange a new place for you.

02:54.560 --> 02:56.160
Otherwise, if word gets out,

02:56.560 --> 02:59.430
people will think Second Madam

02:59.750 --> 03:01.950
mistreats you as head of the household.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.120
The Yunshui satin fabric

03:06.750 --> 03:08.350
is so black that it's creepy.

03:09.030 --> 03:10.190
Those who don't know

03:10.750 --> 03:12.680
might think you're in mourning.

03:13.190 --> 03:15.190
Fourth Lady, you're precious now.

03:16.000 --> 03:18.000
How can you be tainted with bad luck?

03:18.960 --> 03:19.750
It's better

03:21.030 --> 03:21.960
to throw it away.

03:26.430 --> 03:28.710
No wonder you were chosen by Old Madam.

03:29.470 --> 03:30.470
You're obedient

03:31.000 --> 03:32.060
and well-behaved.

03:37.470 --> 03:38.430
Fourth Lady,

03:39.030 --> 03:41.310
the stage has been set up.

03:42.470 --> 03:44.200
You'd better act with caution.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.079
In the ancestral hall,

03:46.079 --> 03:48.750
I add oil to the eternal lamps every day.

03:49.630 --> 03:51.120
I know it best

03:53.630 --> 03:56.150
that a wick burning too strongly

03:57.710 --> 04:00.310
often won't last until dawn.

04:01.190 --> 04:03.870
Don't end up like your dead mother.

04:05.400 --> 04:05.710
You...

04:05.710 --> 04:07.640
This cloak is Lord Yan's favorite.

04:08.520 --> 04:10.030
He lent it to me by chance.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.750
If he know

04:12.240 --> 04:13.900
it was ruined by you like this,

04:14.190 --> 04:16.390
I wonder if your lifespan is long enough

04:16.600 --> 04:17.800
for you to survive

04:18.160 --> 04:19.950
Lord Yan's fury.

04:20.680 --> 04:21.800
Lord Yan?

04:25.360 --> 04:27.600
Then you must keep it safe.

04:28.430 --> 04:29.760
But don't worry, Nanny.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.600
My mother once taught me

04:32.270 --> 04:33.950
to live and let live.

04:34.310 --> 04:36.000
I'll clean this cloak.

04:36.510 --> 04:38.480
Please lead the way, Nanny.

04:40.120 --> 04:41.180
Okay, Fourth Lady.

04:41.270 --> 04:42.270
This way, please.

04:42.270 --> 04:42.930
Step aside.

04:44.310 --> 04:44.950
This way.

04:49.790 --> 04:52.190
[Hanxiang Parlor]

04:53.190 --> 04:53.750
Mother.

05:03.190 --> 05:03.800
Mother,

05:04.430 --> 05:06.630
why are you so distracted today?

05:07.480 --> 05:09.740
Is it because of newly arrived Qingyuan?

05:12.680 --> 05:13.680
About her,

05:14.630 --> 05:16.030
you should listen little

05:16.430 --> 05:17.630
and ask little.

05:18.070 --> 05:20.720
Especially in front of the two Madams,

05:21.600 --> 05:23.600
you must be very discreet

05:23.950 --> 05:25.510
and avoid making trouble.

05:25.950 --> 05:27.800
I've been warning you for years.

05:28.390 --> 05:30.360
You must keep it in mind.

05:33.190 --> 05:35.070
But Qingyuan

05:35.800 --> 05:37.130
seems gentle and quiet.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.680
She should be as easy to get along with

05:39.680 --> 05:40.830
as Fourth Madam was.

05:41.390 --> 05:42.720
Even when Second Madam moved her

05:42.720 --> 05:45.070
to that dilapidated Danyue Pavilion,

05:45.190 --> 05:46.430
she didn't get angry.

05:48.159 --> 05:49.560
Danyue Pavilion.

05:57.000 --> 05:57.800
Mother?

05:58.750 --> 05:59.240
Mother?

06:00.720 --> 06:01.830
Are you all right?

06:05.920 --> 06:07.650
Are you worried that something

06:07.920 --> 06:09.850
might go wrong in Danyue Pavilion?

06:18.270 --> 06:19.240
My Lady!

06:19.950 --> 06:21.550
My Lady! Something is wrong!

06:21.720 --> 06:22.870
Somebody, help!

06:23.510 --> 06:25.160
Wake up, My Lady!

06:25.720 --> 06:26.680
What happened?

06:27.720 --> 06:29.750
What's wrong with you, My Lady?

06:29.750 --> 06:31.600
Come back to us, My Lady!

06:31.830 --> 06:33.430
-My Lady!
-Stay away from me!

06:33.720 --> 06:34.480
My Lady.

06:35.070 --> 06:35.930
Why is your face

06:36.159 --> 06:38.270
so pale and bloodless?

06:38.270 --> 06:39.240
Bloodless?

06:39.600 --> 06:41.060
You're talking nonsense.

06:41.190 --> 06:43.320
She doesn't seem to be Fourth Lady now.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.800
Jin Chunqing.

06:45.630 --> 06:47.230
You contemptible creature.

06:47.480 --> 06:49.510
Murderers should pay with their lives.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.560
Why are you here putting on a show

06:50.560 --> 06:51.960
of madness and specters?

06:52.510 --> 06:54.120
You fool.

06:54.920 --> 06:56.430
Who killed your mother?

06:56.830 --> 06:58.159
Who is your enemy?

06:58.240 --> 06:59.970
Haven't you figured it out yet?

07:00.800 --> 07:01.750
Then tell me,

07:02.040 --> 07:03.070
who exactly is it?

07:03.310 --> 07:04.770
Tell me, who exactly is it?

07:04.830 --> 07:05.240
Right.

07:05.480 --> 07:06.040
Tell us,

07:06.310 --> 07:07.440
who is the murderer?

07:10.390 --> 07:11.750
Isn't this murderer

07:14.070 --> 07:15.870
right here in the Xie Residence?

07:17.750 --> 07:19.150
What exactly do you want?

07:21.870 --> 07:23.070
What do I want?

07:23.770 --> 07:24.360
Don't kill me.

07:24.360 --> 07:25.160
Don't kill me.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.720
Of course I'm here

07:28.190 --> 07:29.560
to seek revenge.

07:41.090 --> 07:44.230
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

07:44.750 --> 07:45.800
Slay all evil.

07:46.159 --> 07:47.240
Subdue all beasts.

07:47.950 --> 07:49.810
By the order of Celestial Master,

07:49.920 --> 07:51.380
divine soldiers, be quick

07:51.480 --> 07:52.610
to obey the command.

08:01.430 --> 08:03.870
Fourth Lady broke the evil miasma
with a blood blade.

08:03.870 --> 08:05.040
Please take a look, everyone.

08:05.040 --> 08:07.970
This crack runs
right through the Jiuquan acupoint.

08:08.030 --> 08:09.630
The evil aura has dispersed.

08:11.510 --> 08:14.710
Although the evil aura
in Danyue Pavilion has dispersed,

08:14.720 --> 08:16.120
Jin Chunqing

08:16.480 --> 08:18.880
seemed to have suffered a great grievance,

08:19.070 --> 08:21.000
resulting in immense resentment.

08:21.240 --> 08:22.700
Even though she vanished,

08:22.870 --> 08:24.200
the remaining evil aura

08:24.510 --> 08:26.910
will still affect the Xie family's fortune

08:27.000 --> 08:28.240
to some extent.

08:31.830 --> 08:32.909
Then...

08:33.480 --> 08:35.120
Then what should we do?

08:35.480 --> 08:36.809
Don't worry, Old Madam.

08:37.510 --> 08:39.080
You just need to restore Danyue Pavilion

08:39.080 --> 08:41.740
to its original state
when Jin Chunqing was here

08:42.120 --> 08:43.780
and purify it with talismans.

08:44.150 --> 08:46.600
And with the power of this mascot
to block the evil,

08:46.600 --> 08:48.400
it'll surely keep the Xie family

08:48.600 --> 08:49.870
safe and sound.

08:50.840 --> 08:51.360
Good.

08:52.150 --> 08:52.840
Good.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.780
What about my granddaughter?

08:57.750 --> 08:59.910
Fourth Lady was possessed
by the vengeful spirit

08:59.910 --> 09:01.360
and lost some vital energy.

09:01.360 --> 09:03.000
I'll melt a talisman in water later.

09:03.000 --> 09:04.860
She'll be fine after drinking it.

09:05.240 --> 09:06.900
Thank you, Celestial Master.

09:11.200 --> 09:12.860
Thank you, Celestial Master.

09:16.150 --> 09:18.080
Stop asking for trouble here.

09:18.750 --> 09:19.750
Don't think I don't know

09:19.750 --> 09:21.960
what your intentions were last night.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.540
Who are you talking about?

09:24.720 --> 09:26.120
Are you talking about me?

09:26.440 --> 09:27.240
Old Madam,

09:27.670 --> 09:29.600
you have really misunderstood me.

09:29.960 --> 09:31.600
We brought this girl back

09:31.600 --> 09:33.270
specifically to exorcise evil spirits.

09:33.270 --> 09:35.080
If I hadn't arrange for her
to stay in Danyue Pavilion,

09:35.080 --> 09:36.540
where else could she stay?

09:36.840 --> 09:37.750
Besides,

09:38.390 --> 09:41.520
to suppress a ghost,
one has to stand right in front of it.

09:41.720 --> 09:42.390
Enough.

09:43.240 --> 09:45.500
I don't want to argue with you about this.

09:45.790 --> 09:46.440
Right now,

09:47.240 --> 09:49.300
the evil spirit has been eradicated.

09:49.440 --> 09:51.030
You all have heard

09:51.390 --> 09:53.250
what Celestial Master just said.

09:54.200 --> 09:55.030
Qingyuan

09:55.870 --> 09:58.510
must stay in the Xie Residence
to ward off evil spirits.

09:58.510 --> 10:01.550
From now on,
whoever harbors evil intentions

10:01.870 --> 10:04.530
and damages
the Xie family's fortune even a bit,

10:05.390 --> 10:07.000
I won't spare them.

10:11.360 --> 10:11.870
Yes.

10:16.000 --> 10:16.720
My Lady.

10:34.150 --> 10:34.950
Grandmother.

10:35.150 --> 10:37.030
I was in a daze last night.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.660
Did I do something wrong again

10:41.480 --> 10:42.810
and harm the Xie family?

10:45.910 --> 10:46.710
It's nothing.

10:47.270 --> 10:48.600
It's all in the past.

10:50.440 --> 10:52.240
As for the restoration of Danyue Pavilion,

10:52.240 --> 10:53.900
go and handle it immediately.

10:54.080 --> 10:54.510
Yes.

10:55.120 --> 10:56.120
You may all leave.

10:57.610 --> 11:00.810
[The Wondrous Being of the Great Void]

10:58.240 --> 10:59.030
Do you want

10:59.750 --> 11:02.010
a vegetarian cake to fill you up a little?

11:02.320 --> 11:02.670
Here.

11:03.440 --> 11:04.840
Thank you, Grandmother.

11:08.110 --> 11:10.120
Old Madam, you're well-versed in Buddhism,

11:10.120 --> 11:11.000
but Taoism

11:11.480 --> 11:12.810
is somewhat different.

11:13.270 --> 11:13.840
Dao,

11:14.240 --> 11:15.600
formless and shapeless,

11:15.600 --> 11:16.800
is born of all things,

11:17.000 --> 11:18.240
yet not born of itself.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.170
The scriptures,

11:19.360 --> 11:20.820
carrying the words of Dao,

11:21.080 --> 11:22.080
clearly show the path of cultivation,

11:22.080 --> 11:23.740
yet do not reveal themselves.

11:25.200 --> 11:25.840
Old Madam,

11:26.600 --> 11:29.750
there is a side hall in the back
where longevity tablets are served.

11:29.750 --> 11:31.210
Would you like to go with me

11:31.480 --> 11:32.870
and light a lamp?

11:35.550 --> 11:38.150
Thank you, Celestial Master.

12:20.270 --> 12:22.360
So Jin Chunqing totally deserved it.

12:22.510 --> 12:24.550
She even tried to harm her own daughter.

12:24.550 --> 12:26.150
She shot herself in the foot.

12:26.550 --> 12:28.030
In the end, she was slashed

12:28.030 --> 12:30.320
into oblivion by Xie Qingyuan.

12:32.870 --> 12:34.870
What poetic justice.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.270
You're right, My Lady.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.130
I think so, too.

12:38.150 --> 12:41.120
Qingyuan made such a scene last night.

12:41.870 --> 12:43.670
It was a pretty convincing act.

12:44.000 --> 12:44.790
What act?

12:47.550 --> 12:48.360
Nothing.

12:48.510 --> 12:49.510
Be careful.

12:49.910 --> 12:51.970
Don't let the fire burn your clothes.

12:58.510 --> 12:59.870
What are you doing?

13:00.550 --> 13:02.780
Why did you throw away
someone else's wishing ribbon?

13:02.780 --> 13:04.740
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

13:06.120 --> 13:08.520
Mine naturally belongs in the very center.

13:09.670 --> 13:11.080
No one can outshine me.

13:12.790 --> 13:13.790
Does it look good?

13:15.630 --> 13:16.510
You're

13:17.510 --> 13:19.630
spoiled rotten by your father.

13:19.790 --> 13:21.450
You always want to be the best.

13:21.960 --> 13:22.670
In the future,

13:22.670 --> 13:24.130
if you marry into a family,

13:24.390 --> 13:26.630
you'll definitely be an intolerant madam.

13:26.630 --> 13:27.840
My husband

13:28.360 --> 13:30.560
will naturally only have me by his side.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.910
Then, Second Lady,

13:33.080 --> 13:35.720
have you asked the young master
of the Marquis of Danyang

13:35.720 --> 13:36.600
if he is willing

13:36.750 --> 13:37.750
to only have a wife

13:37.840 --> 13:38.900
and no concubines?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.480
Mother.

13:41.270 --> 13:42.870
Nanny Liu is making fun of me.

13:43.120 --> 13:45.030
I didn't say I'm going to marry Congxin.

13:45.030 --> 13:45.910
Right.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.080
You don't want to marry him.

13:47.080 --> 13:48.000
Then why did you write his name

13:48.000 --> 13:49.390
on your red ribbon?

13:49.280 --> 13:50.870
[Li Congxin] [Xie Qingru]

13:51.120 --> 13:52.270
That's because

13:53.360 --> 13:55.090
he's the person I miss the most.

13:57.510 --> 13:58.970
The person I miss the most?

14:27.250 --> 14:34.090
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

14:27.320 --> 14:28.250
You can't hit me.

14:28.600 --> 14:29.360
Chunqing,

14:29.750 --> 14:32.720
there is a new development
in the corruption case I'm handling.

14:32.720 --> 14:34.120
I need to go check it out immediately.

14:34.120 --> 14:41.310
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

14:34.630 --> 14:37.910
Could you look after Run for half a day?

14:38.270 --> 14:39.240
When I come back,

14:39.750 --> 14:40.840
I'll pick him up.

14:41.420 --> 14:44.940
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

14:41.550 --> 14:42.480
Rest assured.

14:44.960 --> 14:48.130
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

14:48.150 --> 14:55.290
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

14:55.310 --> 15:02.430
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

14:57.670 --> 14:58.730
Do you want to play?

14:58.840 --> 15:00.040
Let's play together.

15:02.450 --> 15:10.220
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

15:10.240 --> 15:13.540
♪ Rise and fall take turns ♪

15:11.320 --> 15:12.120
Little Loser.

15:12.720 --> 15:13.570
You daren't play?

15:13.570 --> 15:16.970
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

15:14.550 --> 15:15.150
Come on.

15:15.510 --> 15:16.040
Catch me.

15:16.990 --> 15:24.260
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

15:19.480 --> 15:20.150
Don't run.

15:23.150 --> 15:24.750
I'll take you downstairs to play tomorrow.

15:24.340 --> 15:31.140
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

15:24.960 --> 15:25.440
Sure.

15:25.550 --> 15:26.360
I saw there are

15:26.600 --> 15:28.200
a lot of wild pheasants downstairs.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.630
Those are wild ducks.

15:29.840 --> 15:31.160
No matter if they're pheasants or ducks,

15:31.160 --> 15:38.350
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

15:31.360 --> 15:33.240
let's go downstairs
and catch them tomorrow.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.200
Sure.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.600
Let's get a net and catch a bunch.

15:35.600 --> 15:37.030
Who's still up so late?

15:38.030 --> 15:39.790
You little rascal.

15:38.540 --> 15:42.330
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

15:40.120 --> 15:41.360
You're so naughty.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.960
You're a bad influence on Run.

15:42.350 --> 15:45.690
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

15:45.720 --> 15:52.530
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

15:48.080 --> 15:48.870
Run,

15:49.270 --> 15:50.270
go to sleep early.

15:51.630 --> 15:52.360
Be a good boy.

15:52.480 --> 15:54.480
I'll make you lots of yummy food tomorrow.

15:52.550 --> 16:00.490
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

15:55.270 --> 15:55.960
Okay.

15:56.600 --> 15:57.150
Good boy.

16:00.510 --> 16:07.510
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

16:07.530 --> 16:11.480
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

16:11.500 --> 16:14.870
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

16:14.890 --> 16:20.250
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

16:15.550 --> 16:17.210
Let's go catch fish tomorrow.

16:18.480 --> 16:19.600
I can't swim.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.030
You can't do anything.

16:22.870 --> 16:23.910
Little Loser.

16:25.150 --> 16:25.960
Fine.

16:26.320 --> 16:27.580
You can do many things.

16:27.670 --> 16:28.600
I think

16:28.870 --> 16:30.800
you're more like a naughty monkey.

16:31.030 --> 16:31.830
Little Loser.

16:32.110 --> 16:32.840
Little Monkey.

16:32.840 --> 16:33.640
Little Loser.

16:33.720 --> 16:35.240
Little Monkey.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.320
See? You can't catch me.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.120
Give it to me.

16:39.120 --> 16:39.870
No.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.150
Mom,

16:56.870 --> 16:58.470
you look so beautiful today.

16:59.630 --> 17:00.230
Come here,

17:00.440 --> 17:01.670
I'll do your hair too.

17:06.790 --> 17:07.920
I'm

17:08.829 --> 17:10.630
going to see an old friend later.

17:12.270 --> 17:13.550
After I see her,

17:14.960 --> 17:16.480
we'll move, okay?

17:17.160 --> 17:17.790
Move?

17:18.510 --> 17:19.770
Where are we moving to?

17:20.160 --> 17:27.810
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

17:20.750 --> 17:22.109
To a place

17:22.960 --> 17:24.440
where it's always spring

17:25.550 --> 17:27.480
and flowers are blooming all year.

17:27.829 --> 17:34.470
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

17:29.880 --> 17:31.270
As long as you're with me,

17:31.270 --> 17:32.430
I'll go anywhere.

17:34.500 --> 17:38.520
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

17:38.550 --> 17:42.020
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

17:41.590 --> 17:44.110
Mom, can we take Little Loser with us?

17:42.100 --> 17:48.930
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

17:46.350 --> 17:47.400
Little Loser.

17:48.350 --> 17:48.960
Come down.

17:49.000 --> 17:57.530
♪ I chant and sigh; one cup of spring,
drunk through turns of year ♪

17:52.000 --> 17:53.000
You.

17:53.640 --> 17:55.840
Don't give people nicknames causally.

17:55.920 --> 17:56.400
Later,

17:56.480 --> 17:57.680
you and Run go out

17:57.750 --> 17:59.640
and buy some of your favorite sweets.

17:59.640 --> 18:00.550
Thank you, Mom.

18:03.640 --> 18:04.310
Come.

18:04.400 --> 18:06.060
-Come catch me.
-Give it back.

18:06.790 --> 18:08.450
-Come catch me.
-Give it back.

18:08.510 --> 18:10.030
Slow down.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.830
Give it back.

18:24.960 --> 18:26.090
Something's wrong.

18:34.960 --> 18:37.290
What are those people doing in your house?

18:37.880 --> 18:39.010
Come with me, quick!

19:05.070 --> 19:05.680
Mother!

19:30.400 --> 19:31.350
What was that sound?

19:31.350 --> 19:31.830
Chase them.

19:31.830 --> 19:32.400
Up there.

19:33.310 --> 19:33.770
Search.

19:39.000 --> 19:39.830
Mom.

19:39.830 --> 19:40.790
Run!

19:41.030 --> 19:42.590
Mom!

19:43.270 --> 19:43.800
Hurry up.

19:48.110 --> 19:48.790
This way.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.640
Let me go!

19:58.240 --> 19:58.790
Get in!

20:04.160 --> 20:04.820
Over there!

20:06.110 --> 20:06.680
Hurry up!

20:12.400 --> 20:13.160
Mom!

20:20.880 --> 20:22.480
Mom!

21:02.720 --> 21:03.440
Mom.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.070
Mom.

21:06.030 --> 21:06.830
Mom.

21:09.110 --> 21:09.960
Mom.

21:11.070 --> 21:11.830
Mom.

21:12.550 --> 21:13.720
Mom!

21:17.160 --> 21:18.070
Mom!

21:19.350 --> 21:20.400
Mom!

21:20.880 --> 21:21.750
Mom!

21:22.720 --> 21:24.030
Mom!

21:25.310 --> 21:26.310
Let me go!

21:26.440 --> 21:28.310
I'm going to find my mom.

21:30.110 --> 21:31.590
Your mom is already dead.

21:32.310 --> 21:33.750
She is still alive.

21:34.070 --> 21:35.200
Before dawn,

21:35.240 --> 21:36.880
-I went home.
-Let go!

21:37.400 --> 21:39.030
My mom and my younger brother.

21:39.030 --> 21:41.030
All 73 people of our Shen family

21:41.680 --> 21:43.110
were killed by them.

21:55.110 --> 21:56.790
After you passed out last night,

21:56.790 --> 21:57.960
I saw it was safe,

21:58.240 --> 21:59.840
so I went back and took a look.

22:00.110 --> 22:01.170
I didn't expect...

22:01.550 --> 22:02.640
Why don't you cry?

22:03.720 --> 22:04.640
My tears

22:05.310 --> 22:07.040
have dried up since last night.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.270
Without Mom,

22:10.830 --> 22:11.880
I have no home.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.720
What should we do?

22:14.750 --> 22:16.000
How will we survive?

22:17.510 --> 22:19.110
We must remember all of this.

22:19.510 --> 22:20.480
When we grow up,

22:20.750 --> 22:22.480
we must bring the truth to light

22:22.590 --> 22:24.640
and bring the sinners to justice.

22:25.310 --> 22:26.550
Every blood debt

22:26.640 --> 22:27.510
has a name

22:28.240 --> 22:29.370
and must be paid off.

22:31.030 --> 22:31.830
My mom

22:31.960 --> 22:33.560
was the best mom in the world.

22:33.880 --> 22:34.740
I'll make those

22:35.200 --> 22:36.240
who killed her

22:36.240 --> 22:37.750
suffer dearly for this.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.860
My father left this for me.

22:52.070 --> 22:52.880
Take it.

22:55.510 --> 22:56.830
When we meet again,

22:57.640 --> 22:59.640
we'll recognize each other by this.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.440
Are you leaving?

23:03.070 --> 23:04.790
They're looking for me all over the city.

23:04.790 --> 23:06.650
I can't stay in Hengtang anymore.

23:06.790 --> 23:09.160
I don't even know if I can survive.

23:10.830 --> 23:11.680
Trust me.

23:11.960 --> 23:12.880
One day,

23:13.240 --> 23:15.240
I'll definitely return to Hengtang.

23:15.240 --> 23:17.240
We'll surely meet each other again.

23:17.720 --> 23:18.200
Okay.

23:18.400 --> 23:19.400
We have a deal.

23:19.750 --> 23:20.920
When you return to Hengtang,

23:20.920 --> 23:22.180
we'll meet here again.

23:31.270 --> 23:32.680
Later, I learned

23:33.960 --> 23:35.400
his name is Shen Run.

23:36.790 --> 23:38.680
He is the one I've been missing.

23:47.350 --> 23:48.590
Last night,

23:49.000 --> 23:50.730
I was haunted by an evil spirit.

23:53.270 --> 23:55.600
Its face was deathly pale and terrifying.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.590
I took a closer look

23:58.880 --> 24:01.140
and found it was the dead estate manager.

24:01.790 --> 24:03.790
He lay on my bed and refused to leave.

24:04.680 --> 24:06.440
He, weeping blood, asked me

24:07.400 --> 24:09.510
to get justice for him, otherwise...

24:11.480 --> 24:13.540
Otherwise, he would take me with him.

24:14.480 --> 24:16.410
I'll definitely find out the truth

24:17.000 --> 24:19.260
and get justice for that estate manager.

24:21.830 --> 24:23.480
A case

24:24.480 --> 24:26.790
cannot be solved overnight.

24:28.160 --> 24:29.020
Your Lordship,

24:29.030 --> 24:30.240
have you thought of

24:30.880 --> 24:32.110
a countermeasure?

24:33.270 --> 24:35.530
I've already asked a master for a ritual.

24:36.070 --> 24:37.240
He said

24:38.030 --> 24:40.790
it's best to donate some merit
to the dead estate manager

24:40.790 --> 24:42.850
to help him attain early liberation.

24:42.880 --> 24:45.400
This way, I'll be free of the evil spirit,

24:45.640 --> 24:46.640
and the Xie family

24:47.030 --> 24:48.630
will also naturally be safe.

24:51.030 --> 24:51.880
I

24:51.880 --> 24:54.080
will give orders to prepare banknotes.

24:55.160 --> 24:56.750
But the amount of money

24:58.240 --> 24:59.590
isn't a small sum.

24:59.590 --> 25:00.510
Three days.

25:02.160 --> 25:04.070
Don't delay my ritual.

25:06.000 --> 25:06.750
Certainly.

25:07.400 --> 25:07.960
Alright.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.590
By the way,

25:13.350 --> 25:14.200
Old Madam Xie,

25:14.750 --> 25:16.550
I have a cloak made of Yunshui satin

25:16.550 --> 25:17.880
in Fourth Lady's hands.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.160
I hope

25:19.310 --> 25:21.110
she can also bring it along then.

25:22.270 --> 25:23.880
What do you mean?

25:26.110 --> 25:27.070
Nothing.

25:27.400 --> 25:29.880
I just took a shine to Fourth Lady.

25:32.790 --> 25:34.240
Three days later at noon,

25:34.880 --> 25:36.340
Qingyuan will definitely

25:37.200 --> 25:38.680
arrive on time.

25:45.510 --> 25:49.830
Yan Rui has focused only
on our Xie family time and again.

25:50.350 --> 25:53.920
But Hengtang is vast.
Since the wind is blowing,

25:54.590 --> 25:57.920
the eaves bells of all families
should ring.

26:01.830 --> 26:03.200
Celestial Master said

26:03.550 --> 26:04.830
Danyue Pavilion

26:05.070 --> 26:08.480
must be restored exactly as it was before.

26:09.920 --> 26:11.650
It was really difficult for me.

26:11.830 --> 26:14.110
I couldn't sleep for nights,

26:14.440 --> 26:15.510
worrying about it.

26:16.000 --> 26:17.270
But then I thought,

26:17.590 --> 26:19.850
this concerns the family's reputation.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.070
And Old Madam

26:20.060 --> 26:24.270
[Danyue Pavilion]

26:21.240 --> 26:23.400
gave me strict orders repeatedly.

26:23.830 --> 26:24.350
So

26:24.720 --> 26:25.960
I made up my mind.

26:26.310 --> 26:28.160
Even if I had to risk my life,

26:28.310 --> 26:29.960
I must get it done, right?

26:30.350 --> 26:34.030
[Danyue Pavilion]

26:30.640 --> 26:32.470
I've ordered someone to brew

26:32.590 --> 26:34.400
the black tea you love

26:34.590 --> 26:36.160
and keep it warm on the stove.

26:36.160 --> 26:38.400
I wanted you to have a warm sip

26:38.790 --> 26:40.350
as soon as you returned.

26:40.290 --> 26:42.070
[Danyue Pavilion]

26:47.480 --> 26:48.270
Look.

26:49.110 --> 26:51.590
Look at this pitiful look.

26:52.350 --> 26:54.720
If Baoxian weren't standing here,

26:54.920 --> 26:57.160
I would really think

26:57.680 --> 27:00.270
our Fourth Madam had returned.

27:01.880 --> 27:04.680
Fourth Lady can certainly feel

27:04.830 --> 27:06.790
the elders' care for her.

27:07.590 --> 27:09.390
From the ornaments in this room,

27:09.550 --> 27:12.750
it's evident that you and Second Madam
put a lot of effort.

27:12.880 --> 27:13.610
It's my duty.

27:14.680 --> 27:16.680
But the timber

27:17.070 --> 27:18.750
looks like inferior fir wood

27:18.830 --> 27:19.880
with a layer of paint on it.

27:19.880 --> 27:20.790
Nonsense.

27:21.070 --> 27:22.070
What inferior...

27:22.270 --> 27:23.310
How could we

27:23.590 --> 27:25.200
pass off inferior wood as quality one?

27:25.200 --> 27:28.200
Although I don't know how favored
Fourth Madam was back then,

27:28.200 --> 27:29.750
I heard that the items placed in this room

27:29.750 --> 27:31.720
were all top-notch.

27:32.030 --> 27:33.720
But right now, the items in this room

27:33.720 --> 27:34.830
are nothing like them at all.

27:34.830 --> 27:35.680
How?

27:36.590 --> 27:37.250
Take a look.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.310
Baoxian.

27:40.310 --> 27:41.400
Fourth Lady.

27:41.550 --> 27:42.240
Nanny.

27:42.790 --> 27:45.590
Grandmother asked the second branch
to restore Danyue Pavilion.

27:45.590 --> 27:46.350
I know

27:46.640 --> 27:47.960
Second Madam is too busy usually.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.720
She also has to manage the household.

27:49.720 --> 27:50.830
These trivial matters

27:50.830 --> 27:52.490
are all left for you to handle.

27:52.720 --> 27:54.270
The accounts are complicated.

27:54.270 --> 27:56.590
Baoxian just kindly wanted to remind you,

27:56.590 --> 27:58.790
worrying you might be deceived by bad men.

27:58.790 --> 27:59.440
Right.

28:00.400 --> 28:01.070
Look.

28:01.720 --> 28:03.160
Our Fourth Lady

28:03.160 --> 28:04.400
is so reasonable.

28:05.160 --> 28:07.160
Get better eyes and look carefully.

28:07.350 --> 28:08.270
Look.

28:08.310 --> 28:08.910
Over here.

28:09.270 --> 28:10.070
And over here.

28:10.200 --> 28:13.110
These are all top-quality

28:13.480 --> 28:14.550
rosewood.

28:15.160 --> 28:17.030
And the ornaments in the room

28:17.030 --> 28:18.830
are top-notch items that can only be found

28:18.830 --> 28:20.590
in the capital.

28:21.240 --> 28:22.720
This grand Danyue Pavilion

28:22.720 --> 28:24.750
now has the best furnishings

28:25.070 --> 28:26.830
in our residence.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.720
Don't be picky.

28:30.030 --> 28:31.640
I like to be picky.

28:31.960 --> 28:33.000
You damn servant.

28:33.030 --> 28:33.640
Baoxian.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.070
Look at her.

28:37.440 --> 28:38.200
Nanny Na,

28:38.400 --> 28:39.800
you'd better be careful.

28:40.160 --> 28:41.110
I heard

28:41.270 --> 28:44.800
that Grandmother hates people
who line their pockets the most.

28:45.880 --> 28:47.640
If restoring Danyue Pavilion

28:47.680 --> 28:49.590
causes a rift between you and others,

28:49.590 --> 28:51.590
then my sin would be great.

28:53.000 --> 28:54.880
You may not know this, Fourth Lady.

28:54.880 --> 28:55.960
Our residence

28:56.310 --> 28:58.040
has to both keep up appearances

28:58.400 --> 28:59.720
and save money.

28:59.720 --> 29:01.680
You know that Old Madam

29:01.680 --> 29:04.030
never liked extravagance.

29:05.160 --> 29:05.830
Yes.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.360
You're right, Nanny.

29:07.590 --> 29:08.550
No matter what,

29:08.680 --> 29:10.070
thank you for your hard work.

29:10.070 --> 29:11.270
It's my duty.

29:11.390 --> 29:14.200
[Fuyu Fair]

29:12.000 --> 29:12.930
Have a cup of tea.

29:16.750 --> 29:19.510
You're indeed smart, Fourth Lady.

29:20.240 --> 29:21.550
You and your mother

29:22.070 --> 29:23.400
look so alike.

29:23.790 --> 29:24.920
Looking at you,

29:25.440 --> 29:26.720
I'm in a trance.

29:37.680 --> 29:39.720
I heard that Lord Yan likes women

29:39.720 --> 29:41.000
with slender hands.

29:41.110 --> 29:43.400
You must take care of yours, Fourth Lady.

29:46.960 --> 29:47.490
Get lost.

29:53.680 --> 29:55.740
Are you waiting for dinner? Let's go.

29:57.790 --> 30:00.070
My Lady, you're amazing.

30:00.110 --> 30:03.380
[Danyue Pavilion]

30:01.110 --> 30:01.880
Let's go.

30:02.750 --> 30:04.070
This damn old woman.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.790
She's always taking credit for herself.

30:05.790 --> 30:08.070
She must have embezzled a lot of money.

30:08.240 --> 30:10.590
Why hasn't this evil person
gotten her retribution yet?

30:10.590 --> 30:11.680
Take it easy.

30:12.240 --> 30:13.440
Real evil spirits

30:13.440 --> 30:14.970
are all in people's hearts.

30:15.270 --> 30:17.830
They can never be eliminated.

30:18.200 --> 30:20.480
Little ones who rush to the front like her

30:20.640 --> 30:22.570
will be dealt with sooner or later.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.270
Now that you're confirmed as the mascot,

30:25.270 --> 30:27.270
do you have any other plans, My Lady?

30:27.790 --> 30:28.990
Where is Third Madam?

30:29.350 --> 30:30.920
It's said that she had a relapse.

30:30.920 --> 30:31.920
It's inconvenient for her to go out.

30:31.920 --> 30:33.550
She's been hiding
in Hanxiang Parlor these days,

30:33.550 --> 30:35.610
not daring to come out and see guests.

30:35.720 --> 30:37.550
But the third branch is also pitiful,

30:37.550 --> 30:38.950
suppressed everywhere.

30:39.160 --> 30:40.650
Eldest Lady lives a life even worse than

30:40.650 --> 30:43.080
that of a favored maid in the residence.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.670
Can she hide herself from it?

30:47.220 --> 30:49.830
[Danyue Pavilion]

30:47.510 --> 30:48.640
It's not that easy.

30:50.750 --> 30:52.160
By the way, what about the cloak?

30:52.160 --> 30:53.030
Is it washed?

30:53.830 --> 30:54.630
It's cleaned.

30:54.680 --> 30:56.940
Shall we return it to Lord Yan's mansion?

30:58.030 --> 30:59.030
It's not time yet.

30:59.680 --> 31:01.310
You mean

31:01.750 --> 31:02.610
we should wait?

31:03.270 --> 31:04.800
But what are we waiting for?

31:04.960 --> 31:05.790
Fourth Lady.

31:07.930 --> 31:10.150
[Danyue Pavilion]

31:10.270 --> 31:11.000
Fourth Lady.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.620
Old Madam wants to see you.

31:15.400 --> 31:16.440
The wait is over.

31:31.720 --> 31:32.520
Grandmother.

31:33.270 --> 31:34.070
How is it?

31:34.790 --> 31:37.000
Is the room comfortable?

31:38.480 --> 31:40.240
Thank you for your concern, Grandmother.

31:40.240 --> 31:41.510
Danyue Pavilion has been restored

31:41.510 --> 31:43.770
by Second Madam and Nanny Rong very well.

31:44.350 --> 31:45.310
That's good.

31:46.350 --> 31:47.350
From now on,

31:47.640 --> 31:49.480
this is your home.

31:49.830 --> 31:51.090
Feel free to live here.

31:51.350 --> 31:52.810
Everyone in the Xie family

31:53.270 --> 31:54.680
will protect you.

31:56.070 --> 31:56.750
Come here.

31:57.110 --> 31:58.790
Sit next to me.

31:59.830 --> 32:00.480
Yes.

32:04.270 --> 32:05.310
I have

32:05.880 --> 32:07.400
an important thing

32:07.960 --> 32:09.110
for you to handle.

32:10.110 --> 32:11.480
The day before yesterday,

32:11.480 --> 32:13.640
I promised Lord Yan some banknotes.

32:14.070 --> 32:17.830
Take that Yunshui satin cloak with you

32:18.480 --> 32:21.310
and deliver them to him personally.

32:23.640 --> 32:25.480
Grandmother, you must be joking.

32:25.480 --> 32:26.480
In the outer courtyard,

32:26.480 --> 32:28.610
aren't there servants to run errands?

32:30.440 --> 32:33.920
No matter how many precious tribute teas
there are in the capital,

32:33.920 --> 32:37.350
Lord Yan still

32:37.590 --> 32:39.590
prefers Yunya tea.

32:40.200 --> 32:41.350
It's refreshing.

32:44.270 --> 32:46.270
Since you've joined the Xie family,

32:46.640 --> 32:47.960
your life and fate

32:48.400 --> 32:51.200
are tied to the Xie family.

32:52.110 --> 32:54.750
I like your cleverness.

32:55.830 --> 32:57.110
There are some things

32:58.200 --> 32:59.860
that even if I didn't tell you,

33:00.350 --> 33:01.830
you already knew.

33:02.350 --> 33:03.550
Otherwise, that day,

33:03.680 --> 33:04.830
on the boat,

33:05.030 --> 33:07.680
you wouldn't have said those things to me.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.200
Right?

33:13.310 --> 33:14.200
I understood.

33:15.350 --> 33:16.200
That's good.

33:33.880 --> 33:35.610
How come it's you, Fourth Lady?

33:36.270 --> 33:37.830
The Xie family is so inconsiderate.

33:37.830 --> 33:39.430
They asked you to come alone?

33:40.510 --> 33:41.440
Where is Lord Yan?

33:41.440 --> 33:42.480
He's waiting for you in the courtyard.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.480
Follow me please.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.270
-Hurry up.
-Okay.

33:58.790 --> 33:59.440
Hurry up.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.510
His Lordship might have left
for some urgent matter.

34:11.510 --> 34:13.440
Wait here please. I'll go find him.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.280
How frivolous.

34:50.440 --> 34:51.770
What are you looking at?

34:55.550 --> 34:57.630
Are you that curious about me?

34:59.360 --> 35:00.400
Why don't I

35:00.710 --> 35:02.550
show you around?

35:03.110 --> 35:03.970
Your Lordship.

35:04.320 --> 35:06.590
I'm here to deliver banknotes
for my grandmother.

35:06.590 --> 35:07.800
And that cloak.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.230
I've had it cleaned.

35:09.550 --> 35:11.510
I'm returning it to its owner.

35:14.150 --> 35:15.670
Why do I remember

35:16.150 --> 35:17.360
there is also Yunya?

35:22.150 --> 35:22.960
Yunya is here.

35:25.480 --> 35:26.340
Your Lordship.

35:26.550 --> 35:27.360
The tea

35:27.550 --> 35:29.210
needs to be stored carefully,

35:29.480 --> 35:31.480
I've asked a servant to take it down.

35:31.710 --> 35:32.920
But

35:33.590 --> 35:35.710
do you really live in such a place?

35:36.070 --> 35:37.330
Isn't this place good?

35:37.670 --> 35:39.600
It has mountains, water, and wine,

35:40.510 --> 35:42.240
as well as a beauties to admire.

35:43.190 --> 35:44.000
Good.

35:44.920 --> 35:45.880
Very good.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.760
Then I hope you enjoy it.

35:48.630 --> 35:49.890
I'll take my leave now.

35:53.400 --> 35:55.510
I recently learned a new trick.

35:56.360 --> 35:58.160
Since you're so knowledgeable,

35:58.360 --> 36:00.090
why don't you take a look for me?

36:11.000 --> 36:13.000
Turmeric water.

36:22.280 --> 36:23.480
Plant ash.

36:32.230 --> 36:33.480
This way,

36:35.190 --> 36:38.960
one can conjure up a bloody

36:39.190 --> 36:40.670
ghost-killing show.

36:49.150 --> 36:50.280
Isn't it wonderful?

36:52.800 --> 36:53.660
Your Lordship,

36:54.110 --> 36:55.640
what are you talking about?

36:57.710 --> 36:59.630
The Xie Residence is blessed
with great fortune.

36:59.630 --> 37:00.760
How could those monsters and ghosts

37:00.760 --> 37:02.190
possibly enter?

37:08.400 --> 37:08.920
Right.

37:09.670 --> 37:11.200
That's what I thought, too.

37:14.710 --> 37:17.550
But what if the one that entered

37:17.630 --> 37:19.030
is a cunning little fox?

37:27.800 --> 37:29.230
You're so perceptive.

37:29.550 --> 37:31.880
I made a fool of myself in front of you.

37:34.320 --> 37:35.800
Fourth Lady, you always like to play

37:35.800 --> 37:37.110
interesting tricks.

37:38.840 --> 37:40.700
Starting fires with sugar balls.

37:42.550 --> 37:44.550
Stabbing talismans with turmeric.

37:46.000 --> 37:47.200
What about next time?

37:49.710 --> 37:51.110
What will it be next time?

37:55.800 --> 37:56.400
By the way,

38:03.230 --> 38:04.090
Your Lordship,

38:04.280 --> 38:07.680
these are perilla candies I made myself,
taught by my granny.

38:09.880 --> 38:11.030
Please accept them.

38:18.710 --> 38:20.240
Are they made from arsenic?

38:20.800 --> 38:21.860
You must be joking.

38:22.760 --> 38:23.880
How would I dare?

38:25.030 --> 38:26.290
Why wouldn't you dare?

38:27.360 --> 38:28.420
Poison, after all,

38:29.000 --> 38:30.480
must be sugar-coated

38:31.880 --> 38:32.840
to be appealing.

38:33.710 --> 38:36.110
I added borneol and mint.

38:37.110 --> 38:38.970
Interrogations are exhausting.

38:40.880 --> 38:42.030
Keeping one in your mouth

38:42.030 --> 38:43.360
will refresh yourself.

38:53.400 --> 38:54.860
I have to go back to report.

38:54.920 --> 38:56.180
I'll take my leave now.

39:36.560 --> 39:38.860
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

39:47.920 --> 39:49.410
We must remember all of this.

39:49.410 --> 39:51.740
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

39:50.070 --> 39:51.070
When we grow up,

39:51.480 --> 39:53.210
we must bring the truth to light

39:53.360 --> 39:55.440
and bring the sinners to justice.

39:56.070 --> 39:57.000
Every blood debt

39:57.280 --> 39:58.110
has a name

39:57.690 --> 39:59.990
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

39:58.710 --> 39:59.840
and must be paid off.

40:00.110 --> 40:00.920
My mom

40:01.070 --> 40:02.670
was the best mom in the world.

40:02.880 --> 40:03.740
I'll make those

40:03.920 --> 40:05.110
who killed her

40:05.110 --> 40:06.440
suffer dearly for this.

40:09.280 --> 40:09.800
Mother.

40:09.490 --> 40:12.390
[Virtue Blesses for Generations]

40:10.760 --> 40:13.560
The Xie family already regards me
as their mascot.

40:13.920 --> 40:15.110
I, as a chess piece,

40:15.760 --> 40:17.360
have been swallowed by them.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.870
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

40:18.190 --> 40:19.190
Danyue Pavilion.

40:19.710 --> 40:21.000
I've used their hands

40:21.800 --> 40:23.060
to take it back for you.

40:23.840 --> 40:28.500
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

40:24.070 --> 40:25.600
This is just the beginning.

40:26.150 --> 40:27.070
Rest assured.

40:27.400 --> 40:29.030
Every single injustice,

40:29.510 --> 40:31.630
I will clear them

40:32.920 --> 40:34.630
one by one.

40:35.580 --> 40:39.840
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

40:35.880 --> 40:37.670
Since this show has begun,

40:38.280 --> 40:40.410
I must make this good play go all the way

40:40.760 --> 40:43.030
to its liveliest part
to be worth watching.
